<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>SSX86 · 个人空间</title>
<meta name="description" content="SSX86 的个人空间：控制台直达强化学习指南、训练实验场与老友记台词库。三体运动背景，零依赖零构建。">
<meta property="og:title" content="SSX86 · 个人空间">
<meta property="og:description" content="宇宙很大，生活更大。">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://ssx86.github.io/">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#04050a">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%23040509'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='22' cy='26' r='7' fill='%2322d3ee'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='42' cy='24' r='5.5' fill='%23a78bfa'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='32' cy='43' r='4.5' fill='%23f472b6'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style is:global>
  :root{
    --bg:#04050a;
    --bg2:#070912;
    --panel:rgba(13,16,28,.6);
    --panel-solid:rgba(13,16,28,.92);
    --line:rgba(148,163,199,.14);
    --line-strong:rgba(148,163,199,.3);
    --txt:#dfe5f2;
    --dim:#8a93ab;
    --faint:#586078;
    --cyan:#22d3ee;
    --violet:#a78bfa;
    --pink:#f472b6;
    --amber:#f5b85c;
    --sans:"Bahnschrift","SF Pro Display","Segoe UI Variable Display","Avenir Next","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei UI",sans-serif;
    --mono:"Cascadia Code","JetBrains Mono","SF Mono",Consolas,Menlo,monospace;
    --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.7,.2,1);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:84px}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
  ::selection{background:rgba(34,211,238,.28);color:#fff}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px)}

  /* 滚动进度 */
  #progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:2px;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet),var(--pink));z-index:90}

  /* 自定义光标 */
  .cur-dot,.cur-ring{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:99;border-radius:50%;will-change:transform;display:none}
  .cur-dot{width:6px;height:6px;background:var(--cyan)}
  .cur-ring{width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.5);transition:width .25s var(--ease),height .25s var(--ease),border-color .25s,background .25s}
  body.cur-on{cursor:none}
  body.cur-on a,body.cur-on button{cursor:none}
  body.cur-hover .cur-ring{width:54px;height:54px;border-color:rgba(167,139,250,.8);background:rgba(167,139,250,.07)}
  @media (pointer:fine){.cur-dot,.cur-ring{display:block}}

  /* 导航 */
  nav{
    position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:80;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;
    padding:15px clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px);
    font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;
    background:linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(4,5,10,.88),rgba(4,5,10,.4) 72%,transparent);
  }
  nav .logo{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em}
  nav .logo i{font-style:normal;color:var(--cyan)}
  nav .links{display:flex;gap:22px;margin-left:auto}
  nav .links a{color:var(--dim);transition:color .2s;position:relative}
  nav .links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-5px;width:100%;height:1px;background:var(--cyan);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s var(--ease)}
  nav .links a:hover{color:var(--txt)}
  nav .links a:hover::after{transform:scaleX(1)}
  nav .kbd{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--dim);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;background:var(--panel-solid);transition:.25s;cursor:pointer}
  nav .kbd:hover{color:var(--txt);border-color:var(--line-strong)}
  nav .kbd b{font-weight:600;color:var(--cyan)}
  @media (max-width:720px){nav .links{display:none}}

  /* ───── HERO ───── */
  #hero{position:relative;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}
  #gl{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
  #gl-fallback{display:none;position:absolute;inset:0;background:
    radial-gradient(28% 34% at 24% 30%,rgba(34,211,238,.25),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(24% 30% at 76% 26%,rgba(167,139,250,.22),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(26% 34% at 50% 74%,rgba(244,114,182,.18),transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 20% 20%,#fff,transparent),var(--bg)}
  #hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
    background:radial-gradient(125% 95% at 50% 40%,transparent 52%,rgba(4,5,10,.78))}
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:130px 0 30px}
  .hud{position:absolute;z-index:3;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--faint);pointer-events:none}
  .hud b{color:var(--cyan);font-weight:400}
  .hud.tl{top:74px;left:clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px)}
  .hud.tr{top:74px;right:clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px);text-align:right}
  .hud.bl{bottom:36px;left:clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px)}
  .hud.br{bottom:36px;right:clamp(20px,4.5vw,52px);text-align:right}
  .hud .live{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);margin-right:7px;box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--cyan);animation:blink 2.2s infinite}
  @keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}
  #era{transition:color .6s}
  #era.chaotic{color:var(--pink)}
  @media (max-width:720px){.hud.bl,.hud.br{display:none}}

  .kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.32em;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:24px}
  .kicker .now{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--amber);border:1px solid rgba(245,184,92,.35);border-radius:99px;padding:3px 12px;font-size:11px}
  .kicker .now::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--amber);animation:blink 2.6s infinite}
  h1.title{
    font-size:clamp(64px,14vw,156px);line-height:.94;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.01em;
    background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--cyan),var(--violet) 55%,var(--pink));
    background-size:220% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;
    animation:hue 10s linear infinite;filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 36px rgba(34,211,238,.16));
  }
  @keyframes hue{to{background-position:220% 0}}
  .sub{margin-top:20px;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);color:var(--dim)}
  .sub b{color:var(--txt);font-weight:600}
  .quote{margin-top:34px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.28em;color:var(--faint)}
  .quote::before{content:"—— "}
  .cta-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:40px}
  .btn{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:10px;transition:transform .2s var(--ease),box-shadow .3s,border-color .3s;will-change:transform}
  .btn.primary{color:#03212b;font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--cyan),#67e8f9);box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px rgba(34,211,238,.5)}
  .btn.primary:hover{box-shadow:0 10px 38px -6px rgba(34,211,238,.65)}
  .btn.ghost{color:var(--txt);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--panel-solid)}
  .btn.ghost:hover{border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.55);box-shadow:0 0 22px -6px rgba(34,211,238,.3)}
  .btn .arrow{transition:transform .25s var(--ease)}
  .btn:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(4px)}
  .btn .up{transition:transform .25s var(--ease)}
  .btn:hover .up{transform:translate(2px,-2px)}

  /* ───── 区块 ───── */
  section{position:relative;padding:clamp(70px,10vh,118px) 0}
  section.alt{background:var(--bg2)}
  .sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;margin-bottom:clamp(30px,4.5vh,48px);flex-wrap:wrap}
  .sec-no{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:.3em}
  .sec-no::before{content:"// "}
  h2.sec-title{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .sec-title i{font-style:normal;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.45em;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.22em;margin-left:14px;vertical-align:.35em}
  .sec-side{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.16em}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .8s var(--ease),transform .8s var(--ease)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .d1{transition-delay:.08s}.d2{transition-delay:.16s}

  /* ───── 控制台 ───── */
  .launch-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px}
  .launch{
    position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:28px 26px 24px;border-radius:16px;
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;
    transition:border-color .3s,box-shadow .35s,transform .15s ease-out;
    transform-style:preserve-3d;will-change:transform;min-height:220px;
  }
  .launch::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-1px;border-radius:17px;padding:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(130deg,rgba(34,211,238,.6),rgba(167,139,250,.45) 45%,transparent 72%);
    -webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;
    opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;pointer-events:none}
  .launch:hover::before{opacity:1}
  .launch:hover{box-shadow:0 24px 56px -22px rgba(34,211,238,.26)}
  .launch .glow{position:absolute;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;
    background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(34,211,238,.13),transparent 65%);
    left:var(--gx,50%);top:var(--gy,50%);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
  .launch:hover .glow{opacity:1}
  .launch .top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--faint)}
  .launch .badge{color:var(--amber);border:1px solid rgba(245,184,92,.4);border-radius:99px;padding:2px 10px}
  .launch .badge.live{color:#34d399;border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.4)}
  .launch .badge.interact{color:var(--cyan);border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.4)}
  .launch h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:700;margin-top:6px}
  .launch h3 small{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;font-weight:400;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.16em}
  .launch p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dim);flex:1;margin-top:2px}
  .launch .foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:14px}
  .launch .key{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 9px;color:var(--dim)}
  .launch .go{color:var(--cyan)}
  .hint-line{margin-top:22px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.14em}
  .hint-line b{color:var(--dim);font-weight:400;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:1px 7px;margin:0 2px}

  /* ───── 遗迹 ───── */
  .relic-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:14px}
  .relic{
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:20px 22px;border-radius:13px;
    background:rgba(10,12,22,.5);border:1px solid var(--line);
    transition:border-color .3s,transform .3s var(--ease);
  }
  .relic:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .relic .meta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--faint)}
  .relic h4{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--dim);transition:color .25s}
  .relic:hover h4{color:var(--txt)}
  .relic p{font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);line-height:1.7}
  .relic.gh{justify-content:center;text-align:center}
  .relic.gh h4{color:var(--dim)}

  /* ───── 页脚 ───── */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:34px 0 42px}
  footer .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px 36px;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.1em}
  footer a{color:var(--dim);transition:color .2s}
  footer a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
  footer .quote2{letter-spacing:.24em}

  /* ───── 命令面板 ───── */
  #palette-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(3,4,8,.62);display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding-top:14vh}
  #palette-backdrop.open{display:flex;animation:fade .18s ease}
  @keyframes fade{from{opacity:0}}
  #palette{width:min(560px,92vw);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--panel-solid);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);box-shadow:0 40px 100px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.85),0 0 60px -20px rgba(34,211,238,.22);animation:pop .22s var(--ease)}
  @keyframes pop{from{transform:scale(.96) translateY(-8px);opacity:0}}
  #palette .in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  #palette .in svg{flex:none;opacity:.6}
  #palette input{flex:1;background:none;border:none;outline:none;color:var(--txt);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.04em}
  #palette input::placeholder{color:var(--faint)}
  #pal-esc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--faint);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px}
  #pal-list{max-height:46vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:8px}
  #pal-list .item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:11px 12px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--dim);cursor:pointer}
  #pal-list .item .ic{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--faint);letter-spacing:.1em;min-width:44px}
  #pal-list .item.on{background:rgba(34,211,238,.1);color:var(--txt)}
  #pal-list .item.on .ic{color:var(--cyan)}
  #pal-list .item .h{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--faint)}
  #pal-empty{padding:22px;text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--faint)}

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    *,*::before,*::after{animation-duration:.01ms !important;animation-iteration-count:1 !important;transition-duration:.01ms !important}
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="progress"></div>
<div class="cur-dot"></div>
<div class="cur-ring"></div>

<nav>
  <a class="logo" href="#hero">ssx86<i>.io</i></a>
  <div class="links">
    <a href="#console">控制台</a>
    <a href="#archive">遗迹</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/ssx86" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
  </div>
  <span class="kbd" id="kbd-hint"><b>⌘K</b> 总控台</span>
</nav>

<!-- ═══════════ HERO · 三体运动 ═══════════ -->
<header id="hero">
  <canvas id="gl"></canvas>
  <div id="gl-fallback"></div>

  <div class="hud tl"><span class="live"></span>THREE_BODY_SIM :: RUNNING</div>
  <div class="hud tr">PERSONAL_SPACE<br>EST.2013 → NOW</div>
  <div class="hud bl">X <b id="coord-x">0.500</b> · Y <b id="coord-y">0.500</b><br>FPS <b id="fps">--</b> · RENDER <b id="rscale">1.0×</b></div>
  <div class="hud br">SHIP_TIME <b id="clock">--:--:--</b><br>ERA <b id="era">恒纪元</b></div>

  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">
      <span>个人空间</span>
      <span class="now">NOW_LEARNING : REINFORCEMENT_LEARNING</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="title" data-scramble-text="SSX86">SSX86</h1>
    <p class="sub">控制台直达我常用的地方，<b>遗迹</b>收着写完的东西。</p>
    <p class="quote">宇宙很大，生活更大。</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#console" data-magnetic>进入控制台 <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="https://github.com/ssx86" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-magnetic>GitHub <span class="up">↗</span></a>
      <span class="btn ghost" id="pal-open" data-magnetic>⌘K 总控台</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══════════ 控制台 ═══════════ -->
<section id="console">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="sec-no">01</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" data-scramble>控制台<i>CONSOLE</i></h2>
      <span class="sec-side">KEY 1 / 2 / 3 · ⌘K</span>
    </div>
    <div class="launch-grid">
      <a class="launch reveal" href="https://ssx86.github.io/rl-field-guide/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tilt data-hotkey="1">
        <span class="glow"></span>
        <div class="top"><span>MODULE_A</span><span class="badge">连载中</span></div>
        <h3>强化学习野外指南<small>RL FIELD GUIDE</small></h3>
        <p>从零到实践的双语指南，正在推进到 LLM 强化学习。</p>
        <div class="foot"><span>ssx86.github.io/rl-field-guide</span><span class="key">1</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="launch reveal d1" href="https://ssx86.github.io/rl-training-lab/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tilt data-hotkey="2">
        <span class="glow"></span>
        <div class="top"><span>MODULE_B</span><span class="badge interact">可交互</span></div>
        <h3>RL 训练实验场<small>RL TRAINING LAB</small></h3>
        <p>Q-learning、DQN、TD3 开小车，训练过程全程可视。</p>
        <div class="foot"><span>ssx86.github.io/rl-training-lab</span><span class="key">2</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="launch reveal d2" href="https://ssx86.github.io/friends-scripts/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tilt data-hotkey="3">
        <span class="glow"></span>
        <div class="top"><span>MODULE_C</span><span class="badge live">每日在用</span></div>
        <h3>老友记台词库<small>FRIENDS SCRIPTS</small></h3>
        <p>十季 183 集全台词，搜索与阅读。看剧学英语的日常工具。</p>
        <div class="foot"><span>ssx86.github.io/friends-scripts</span><span class="key">3</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="launch reveal d2" href="https://ssx86.github.io/schulte-lab/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-tilt data-hotkey="4">
        <span class="glow"></span>
        <div class="top"><span>MODULE_D</span><span class="badge interact">专注力</span></div>
        <h3>舒尔特训练场<small>SCHULTE LAB</small></h3>
        <p>七种舒尔特变种：经典、字母、诗词、红黑切换、抗干扰、倒序、缺失数字。</p>
        <div class="foot"><span>ssx86.github.io/schulte-lab</span><span class="key">4</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="hint-line reveal">提示：按 <b>1</b> <b>2</b> <b>3</b> <b>4</b> 直接发射 · <b>⌘K</b> 打开总控台</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ 遗迹 ═══════════ -->
<section id="archive" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="sec-no">02</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" data-scramble>遗迹<i>ARCHIVE</i></h2>
      <span class="sec-side">PAST_CIVILIZATIONS</span>
    </div>
    <div class="relic-row">
      <a class="relic reveal" href="https://github.com/ssx86/sslang" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="meta">2017 · C++</span>
        <h4>sslang</h4>
        <p>一门手写的玩具编程语言。词法、语法、求值，全部从零。</p>
      </a>
      <a class="relic reveal d1" href="https://github.com/ssx86/nn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <span class="meta">2023 · JAVASCRIPT</span>
        <h4>nn</h4>
        <p>手写神经网络，零框架，自带训练数据归档。</p>
